{"status":"ready","content":"Let's solve this step by step:\r\n\r\n1) First, calculate the mean $\\bar{x}$\r\n   • $\\bar{x} = \\frac{1 - 21 - 21 - 18 + 8}{5}$\r\n   • $\\bar{x} = \\frac{-51}{5}$\r\n   • $\\bar{x} = -10.2$\r\n\r\n2) Subtract the mean from each data point and square the differences\r\n   • $(1 - (-10.2))^2 = (11.2)^2 = 125.44$\r\n   • $(-21 - (-10.2))^2 = (-10.8)^2 = 116.64$\r\n   • $(-21 - (-10.2))^2 = (-10.8)^2 = 116.64$\r\n   • $(-18 - (-10.2))^2 = (-7.8)^2 = 60.84$\r\n   • $(8 - (-10.2))^2 = (18.2)^2 = 331.24$\r\n\r\n3) Sum these squared differences\r\n   • $125.44 + 116.64 + 116.64 + 60.84 + 331.24 = 750.8$\r\n\r\n4) Divide by $(n-1) = 4$\r\n   • $750.8 \\div 4 = 187.7$\r\n\r\n5) Take the square root\r\n   • $\\sqrt{187.7} = \\sqrt{187.7}$\r\n\r\nTherefore, $\\boxed{\\sqrt{187.7}}$\r\n\r\nThe answer is $\\boxed{\\sqrt{187.7}}$.\r\n","path":"responses/claude-3-5-haiku/livebench-070-math.txt","size":792,"mtime":1779363929}